[{:db/id "q-89515/selection/adba33f6c1999228591a40a9713f2514e0309290dd79e3af538dbd27ff991fde" :answer/id #uuid "8658aed8-844d-5bdc-8f89-c8c630879826" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L{f(t)}={e}^{-3s}-{e}^{-s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-89515/selection/a4a8d9cf83adecef954b10cf78f2913ba366c23b7523286f4362d1526f8a8da2" :answer/id #uuid "7213617b-94ad-58e2-a114-21381474718f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L{f(t)}=\\frac{7}{s}({e}^{-3s}-{e}^{-s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-89515/selection/193b500e5950e89b081c2e16e6af980187eac35699e4b54a1027135bf2887d77" :answer/id #uuid "c8d56e41-d8d3-5a99-b322-e2fa2106ade0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L{f(t)}={e}^{-7s}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-89515/selection/6fd891165c6d31f5551781e48d063bd42a1daadbe3bb28aa8ed9bfa22bd2ae2a" :answer/id #uuid "d44c7d37-1812-5c96-a915-a6fc7aa5d7bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L{f(t)}=\\frac{1}{7}({e}^{3s}-{e}^{s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-89515/selection/5bc36a0a6e00b62ca3cb86e3b434da241f593e16c0668d78f17fc0189707b180" :answer/id #uuid "760fb3c7-cbde-50dd-9475-960194142730" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "L{f(t)}=\\frac{1}{s}(1-{e}^{7s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-89515/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f0d5ec79-f08f-57a3-a902-728d652ef71a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-89515/selection/a4a8d9cf83adecef954b10cf78f2913ba366c23b7523286f4362d1526f8a8da2" :answer-field/choices ["q-89515/selection/adba33f6c1999228591a40a9713f2514e0309290dd79e3af538dbd27ff991fde" "q-89515/selection/a4a8d9cf83adecef954b10cf78f2913ba366c23b7523286f4362d1526f8a8da2" "q-89515/selection/193b500e5950e89b081c2e16e6af980187eac35699e4b54a1027135bf2887d77" "q-89515/selection/6fd891165c6d31f5551781e48d063bd42a1daadbe3bb28aa8ed9bfa22bd2ae2a" "q-89515/selection/5bc36a0a6e00b62ca3cb86e3b434da241f593e16c0668d78f17fc0189707b180"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-89515" :question/id #uuid "00dd8ce2-12a0-578b-bdb4-79fe7d1127f9" :question/math-academy-id "q-89515" :question/problem "Find $L{f(t)}$ for the piecewise function defined by \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t)={\\begin{aligned}0,\\, & t<1 \\\\ -7,\\, & 1\\le t\\le 3 \\\\ 0,\\, & t>3.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We apply the definition of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{f(t)} & =F(s)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}f(t)\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the piecewise function \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t)={\\begin{aligned}0\\, & \\text{for}\\,\\,t<1 \\\\ -7\\, & \\text{for}\\,\\,1\\le t\\le 3 \\\\ 0\\, & \\text{for}\\,\\,t>3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}f(t)\\text{d}t={\\int }_{1}^{3}(-7){e}^{-st}\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe calculate this definite integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}(-7){e}^{-st}\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\frac{7}{s}{e}^{-st}|}_{1}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{s}({e}^{-3s}-{e}^{-s})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Laplace transform of $f(t)$ is\n\n$$\nL{f(t)}=\\frac{7}{s}({e}^{-3s}-{e}^{-s}).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-89515/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ec39e02-0c39-5aa4-90e2-3477259d6262"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-89515"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340886/field-1/41026cd402f91a1b897771243bd1739561bdac012afe7805789d216eb0f08467" :answer/id #uuid "717b84c8-0e96-58bf-84bc-1948b3da34ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}(1-{e}^{-5s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340886/field-1/0d7f43daf4ee1f9cbf3ad23258d5d0a76c0f4460821763277a0d7e020481e8a3" :answer/id #uuid "e21e27ad-34cb-551e-beb0-9fdef7a86088" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{s}(1+{e}^{-5s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340886/field-1/ae2029e2af80460837b6fe04d7437358c46a0b925212f23666660ad7167e3568" :answer/id #uuid "dd3ba88f-acfe-516c-814e-29681aa1eba4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}(1+{e}^{-5s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340886/field-1/3c60d725067d67a71ce7746439e3913456b35db0e5dcd390f422527b212602f7" :answer/id #uuid "cf36838c-ff48-5e53-80de-138e02058a38" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}({e}^{-5s}-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340886/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "74f47699-2694-5266-a56e-bc96d91cf802" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340886/field-1/41026cd402f91a1b897771243bd1739561bdac012afe7805789d216eb0f08467" :answer-field/choices ["q-340886/field-1/41026cd402f91a1b897771243bd1739561bdac012afe7805789d216eb0f08467" "q-340886/field-1/0d7f43daf4ee1f9cbf3ad23258d5d0a76c0f4460821763277a0d7e020481e8a3" "q-340886/field-1/ae2029e2af80460837b6fe04d7437358c46a0b925212f23666660ad7167e3568" "q-340886/field-1/3c60d725067d67a71ce7746439e3913456b35db0e5dcd390f422527b212602f7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340886" :question/id #uuid "0a4cacbc-5afe-5933-a4d7-e3e3664819fe" :question/math-academy-id "q-340886" :question/problem "Use the definition of Laplace transforms to calculate $F(s)=L{f(t)}$ for $s>0,$ where $f(t)=u(5-t)$ and $u$ is the unit step function.$\\,F(s)=L{f(t)}=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We apply the definition of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{f(t)} & =F(s)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }f(t){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that the unit step function is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(t)={\\begin{aligned}0,\\, & t<0 \\\\ 1,\\, & t\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, for the piecewise function \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(5-t)={\\begin{aligned}1,\\, & t\\le 5 \\\\ 0,\\, & t>5\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }u(5-t){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}1\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{5}^{\\infty }0\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe compute this integral for $s>0$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{5}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{{e}^{-st}}{s}]}_{0}^{5} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{e}^{-5s}}{s}+\\frac{1}{s} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s}(1-{e}^{-5s})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-340886/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ec39e02-0c39-5aa4-90e2-3477259d6262"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340886"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-1/7ab6c09925b077cc6521f2ad53ada16ff50ecdb3e490d8b9c7b2bcefc93c5a6d" :answer/id #uuid "ad54bee2-24a0-5962-9c66-5cf55e33a6a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{2}{s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-1/d0076c54cd7701d155263cffe2fa9a97e9b9d4cdc6cc3eb17767a012f85e110c" :answer/id #uuid "42dde035-4931-5008-8d90-8ba652f1a12f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s}+\\frac{2}{s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-1/af45ca50f5a51fec72c486a5957bef6ec660940c773c2b1087d0d24aad285019" :answer/id #uuid "5c3d9dfb-2596-50b1-8754-972c61b166cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2{e}^{-4s}}{s}+\\frac{1}{s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-1/3316db7c535e279fa403a65a065834e9ed97f334283af7bd05f815e91b8c91e4" :answer/id #uuid "c2218c82-e0fe-506a-a589-71fd63a74ad2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}-\\frac{2{e}^{-4s}}{s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-1/8680d89271288618ad4579c82f00a0cdd58320e467fe4912ecadb239edf1a53b" :answer/id #uuid "2857b654-b96c-5693-bdde-fe51c492cc3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "846094c0-121d-5b5c-9cf0-12a30fd17c38" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340932/field-1/8680d89271288618ad4579c82f00a0cdd58320e467fe4912ecadb239edf1a53b" :answer-field/choices ["q-340932/field-1/7ab6c09925b077cc6521f2ad53ada16ff50ecdb3e490d8b9c7b2bcefc93c5a6d" "q-340932/field-1/d0076c54cd7701d155263cffe2fa9a97e9b9d4cdc6cc3eb17767a012f85e110c" "q-340932/field-1/af45ca50f5a51fec72c486a5957bef6ec660940c773c2b1087d0d24aad285019" "q-340932/field-1/3316db7c535e279fa403a65a065834e9ed97f334283af7bd05f815e91b8c91e4" "q-340932/field-1/8680d89271288618ad4579c82f00a0cdd58320e467fe4912ecadb239edf1a53b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-2/23424e5dffaca1bffc81dd2cc015a958b04177158815d98fdd41149314b3d874" :answer/id #uuid "0eb03899-44d9-5e3c-ac1a-400c9922ea58" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s>4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-2/34021d3854d8d25832b91720cc624a8e35c2f6fd4d7bab524d021edef59e6673" :answer/id #uuid "995ec693-0406-5bf9-ba50-674d81c0c350" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s\\ge 4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-2/de63348529d477cd70740ab9581d04b231678372657a4ecc21dd12e21b5d033c" :answer/id #uuid "f50a1035-d7e5-594b-83d8-f78405e40a95" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-2/9d34e85dabb5082358af9360d93c7ce717fcea0db3670310b8eab46db4fc35b5" :answer/id #uuid "ec0a59ff-3035-5682-b1dd-c1c0f033e955" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "s\\ge 0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "7582edcb-4623-5a6e-9189-b5330e7ed5a3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340932/field-2/de63348529d477cd70740ab9581d04b231678372657a4ecc21dd12e21b5d033c" :answer-field/choices ["q-340932/field-2/23424e5dffaca1bffc81dd2cc015a958b04177158815d98fdd41149314b3d874" "q-340932/field-2/34021d3854d8d25832b91720cc624a8e35c2f6fd4d7bab524d021edef59e6673" "q-340932/field-2/de63348529d477cd70740ab9581d04b231678372657a4ecc21dd12e21b5d033c" "q-340932/field-2/9d34e85dabb5082358af9360d93c7ce717fcea0db3670310b8eab46db4fc35b5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340932" :question/id #uuid "25e532b1-d332-5b0d-bf0b-74f3f071e83b" :question/math-academy-id "q-340932" :question/problem "Use the definition of Laplace transforms to calculate $F(s)=L{f(t)},$ where $f(t)$ is given by \n\n$$\nf(t)={\\begin{aligned}-1,\\, & x\\le 4 \\\\ 1\\, & x>4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$\\,F(s)=L{f(t)}=$ {{field-1}},\nvalid for {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "We apply the definition of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{f(t)} & =F(s)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }f(t){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, for the piecewise function \n\n$$\nf(t)={\\begin{aligned}-1,\\, & x\\le 4 \\\\ 1\\, & x>4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }f(t){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{4}(-1)\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }1\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{0}^{4}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that the improper integral diverges if $s\\le 0.$\n\nFor $s>0,$ we calculate our Laplace transform as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & =-{\\int }_{0}^{4}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s}{[{e}^{-st}]}_{0}^{4}+{\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}+{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{4}^{a}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}+{lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{(-\\frac{{e}^{-st}}{s})|}_{4}^{a} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }({e}^{-sa}-{e}^{-4s}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}(0-{e}^{-4s}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}+\\frac{{e}^{-4s}}{s} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{e}^{-4s}}{s}-\\frac{1}{s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nvalid for $s>0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-340932/field-1" "q-340932/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ec39e02-0c39-5aa4-90e2-3477259d6262"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340932"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-341398/field-1/f1deb7c37832b563269464ffe63f4fed41efc30b054aa2855596a2c77b783e96" :answer/id #uuid "589c5a75-15cb-5712-b9b1-06accaa7d458" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}(1+{e}^{-8s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341398/field-1/613772d8e668af19b10b617ce138f7af0ffd6b89cea0352c977b010d887833ff" :answer/id #uuid "8dc4e037-c2ef-5b6f-8344-e7aac2fb8795" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}(1-{e}^{-8s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341398/field-1/fa220f4a07a1462f8c458de8df514ccbba36a63ec8e37688a9de0d703e035294" :answer/id #uuid "cafef4e6-f7c8-50cb-87df-c122286c0964" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{s}(1+{e}^{-8s})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341398/field-1/8d8c66550394dbe478785a0b78a6bd87b62e9c697a3d47efcba40739be587e7d" :answer/id #uuid "b38573a6-44db-565c-aff6-a067b0c22c1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}({e}^{-8s}-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341398/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "218750eb-e2c4-5ce3-befb-f9a63487f08d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-341398/field-1/613772d8e668af19b10b617ce138f7af0ffd6b89cea0352c977b010d887833ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-341398/field-1/f1deb7c37832b563269464ffe63f4fed41efc30b054aa2855596a2c77b783e96" "q-341398/field-1/613772d8e668af19b10b617ce138f7af0ffd6b89cea0352c977b010d887833ff" "q-341398/field-1/fa220f4a07a1462f8c458de8df514ccbba36a63ec8e37688a9de0d703e035294" "q-341398/field-1/8d8c66550394dbe478785a0b78a6bd87b62e9c697a3d47efcba40739be587e7d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-341398" :question/id #uuid "794abdcb-950e-54b9-b040-f1e3c0111c67" :question/math-academy-id "q-341398" :question/problem "Use the definition of Laplace transforms to calculate $F(s)=L{f(t)}$ for $s>0,$ where $f(t)=u(8-t)$ and $u$ is the unit step function.$\\,F(s)=L{f(t)}=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We apply the definition of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{f(t)} & =F(s)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }f(t){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that the unit step function is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(t)={\\begin{aligned}0,\\, & t<0 \\\\ 1,\\, & t\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, for the piecewise function \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(8-t)={\\begin{aligned}1,\\, & t\\le 8 \\\\ 0,\\, & t>8\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }u(8-t){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{8}1\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{8}^{\\infty }0\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{8}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe compute this integral for $s>0$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{8}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{{e}^{-st}}{s}]}_{0}^{8} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{e}^{-8s}}{s}+\\frac{1}{s} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s}(1-{e}^{-8s})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-341398/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ec39e02-0c39-5aa4-90e2-3477259d6262"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-341398"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-341390/field-1/f1d47beda7d3f0086acc354dd9d1f228e135757133ac9d869e15539b7384eaa3" :answer/id #uuid "2fa4e5ea-4212-52bb-9bc8-fffb0353923e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{e^{-3s}}{s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341390/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "46b2494e-1156-5ff2-9b36-95e598c10e6c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-341390/field-1/f1d47beda7d3f0086acc354dd9d1f228e135757133ac9d869e15539b7384eaa3" :answer-field/choices ["q-341390/field-1/f1d47beda7d3f0086acc354dd9d1f228e135757133ac9d869e15539b7384eaa3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-341390/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa" :answer/id #uuid "1170717d-397e-54bd-9e39-81a6a2934376" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value ">" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341390/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "8d1333bc-25d9-54dc-8549-d527d0bf7b38" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-341390/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa" :answer-field/choices ["q-341390/field-2/22814de28a0b1b4f20d5edd62707d192b78050d457a70349795d30d86dfcd7fa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-341390/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "c1758e97-d042-5ad6-8009-2fa1ad1a4ec9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341390/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "872136bb-f2c4-5e8f-a398-dc46f743887c" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-341390/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-341390/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-341390" :question/id #uuid "f0249688-b769-5c6c-909c-995e30a9535e" :question/math-academy-id "q-341390" :question/problem "Use the definition of Laplace transforms to calculate $F(s)=L{f(t)},$ where $f(t)=u(t-3)$ and $u$ is the unit step function.\n\n$F(s)=L{f(t)}=$\n{{field-1}},\nvalid for $s\\,$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}." :question/worked-solution "We apply the definition of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{f(t)} & =F(s)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }f(t){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRecall that the unit step function is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(t)={\\begin{aligned}0,\\, & t<0 \\\\ 1,\\, & t\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, for the piecewise function \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(t-3)={\\begin{aligned}0,\\, & t<3 \\\\ 1,\\, & t\\ge 3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }u(t-3){e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}0\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{3}^{\\infty }1\\cdot {e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{3}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that this improper integral diverges if $s\\le 0.$\n\nFor $s>0,$ we calculate this integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{3}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{3}^{a}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{(-\\frac{{e}^{-st}}{s})|}_{3}^{a} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{s}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }({e}^{-sa}-{e}^{-3s}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{s}(0-{e}^{-3s}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{-3s}}{s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Laplace transform of $f(t)$ is\n\n$$\nL{f(t)}=\\frac{{e}^{-3s}}{s},\\,s>0.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-341390/field-1" "q-341390/field-2" "q-341390/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8ec39e02-0c39-5aa4-90e2-3477259d6262"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-341390"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-341465/field-1/3d3b5eb8485dea24253b60fb55859491d831b959601b29ef492473203a9640b0" :answer/id #uuid "ca32bd51-ae12-5a44-8d62-f918865cf7f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/v